{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"闭子概形"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“闭子概形”"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},3],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>闭子概形 $\\iota \\colon  Y\\to X$ 给出正合列\n$$\r\n0\\to\\mathcal I_{Y/X} \\to \\mathcal O_X \\to \\iota_* \\mathcal O_Y \\to 0.\r\n$$\n其中 $\\iota_*\\mathcal O_Y$ 又记作 $\\mathcal O|_Y$.</p>\n<p>当 $Y$ 是 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"除子","text":"除子"}},{"Plain":"时, "},{"Local":{"url":"理想层","text":"理想层"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal I_{Y/X}$ 是 $\\mathcal O_X(-Y)$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}